From 073d0a5a3ff88d958f94c2ae50a67bc92476f616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:26:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 37/37] statements r2: G51-01..11

G51-01: clarify familywise security quantification.
G51-02: add the supported-key Boolean-circuit size target; retain the TM target.
G51-03: retain r1 fixed width and require explicit state/value encoding bounds.
G51-04: prefix all sampler parameter maps with the security parameter.
G51-05: remove the unused adversary binder from uniform MDDH preprocessing.
G51-06..08: report W6 and the requested owner-API promotions.
G51-09: reuse the existing list-of-words encoder.
G51-10: remove unused Pairing references.
G51-11: correct checkpoint-0 publication and freeze-start reporting.

All dispositions and the exact frozen-header list are in the checkpoint REPORT.md.
Source-only native parsing and static checks were run. The maintainer owns Lean replay.
Saved proof development is excluded from this isolated statement-change commit.
